flowchart LR
  subgraph lead[Lead context: small by rule]
    plan[PLAN.md]
    idx[findings/INDEX.md under 200 lines]
    status[one status line per facet]
    sum[last worker summaries, 10 lines each]
  end
  subgraph worker[Worker context: disposable]
    pages[fetched pages, search results,<br/>DeepWiki answers, snapshots]
    note[note file written to disk]
  end
  subgraph disk[Disk: source of truth]
    notes[runs/slug/notes/*.md]
    findings[findings/*.md]
  end
  pages --> note --> notes
  note -. "path + summary only" .-> sum
  notes --> findings
  findings -. "one line each" .-> idx
  compact[/compact at phase boundaries<br/>keeps PLAN, INDEX, paths, rulings/] --> lead
  hook[SessionStart hook on compact and clear<br/>active PLAN.md top 60 lines, newest 30 INDEX lines] --> lead
